os64 ships three seconds of it as /tests/pages/bbb-480p-3s.mp4, a test
clip for the H.264 decoder (/tests/avbench). It was cut from the film's
2013 "sunflower" 1080p 60 fps release (bbb_sunflower_1080p_60fps_normal.mp4,
from https://distribution.bbb3d.renderfarming.net/), starting 6:55 into the
film, scaled to 854x480 at 30 frames a second and encoded with x264 at
about 1 Mbit/s. The changes are those, and the cut.
